WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.336
You must prepare Lissa
 for her new role

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.505
as head of the Dragomir family.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.589
And Rose?

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:07.966
She'll do her duty.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.219
Is this something that you want?

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:14.264
There are a parade of people
dying to be on the throne.

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:17.392
The only thing separating
 this dominion

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.310
from that fate is me.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.858
Then go out there, and show
them all what you've got.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.401
And if I've got nothing?

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.903
Then I will get you out,
I promise you that.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.949
Guardians are raised
 to be tough.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.328
No matter how good you are,

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:39.539
there's good enough 
and there's gone.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:43.752
I want to protect my best friend

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:44.544
from danger.

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:45.795
Good.

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:54.012
You staying out of trouble?

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:56.598
Oh, you know me. I'm
always dancing alongside of it.

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:02.187
There's something 
strange happening.

00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:09.194
We will survive, because
there is no other option.

